Z||000000||Cheever3000||10-05-2001||08:46 PM||||Hello again.  Some of you may remember me, I come here occassionally, hehe.  <P>I have a copy of the Wall Street Journal dated September 11, 2001, in excellent condition.  It came out that morning before the attack, so there's nothing in it about that.  But it's got the date.  Think it will be worth any money some day? <P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||btoth||10-05-2001||09:46 PM||||I have my NY Times from 9/11, had to get them this semester for my poly sci class, my subcription had just started that Monday.  I'm going to hold on to it, but not as an investment  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">.<P>BTW, my dad still has the moonlanding newspaper stored away somewhere.  That is pretty cool... I just looked it once, one day I should actually read the thing.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
